{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0000", "text": "من ترا دوست دارم.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0001", "text": "من اسپرانتو را بیشتر از آلمانی دوست دارم.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0002", "text": "حزب حاکم قدرت خود را تثبیت نمود.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0003", "text": "آن حزب حاکم اقتدار خویش را تثبیت کرد.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0004", "text": "امشب کجا برویم.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0005", "text": "آیا می‌توانی شلنگ آب را به من قرض بدهی؟", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0006", "text": "او جرأت نکرد چیزی بگوید.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0007", "text": "من در محل معمول منتظرت خواهم بود.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0008", "text": "نژادپرستی در همهٔ جوامع معمول است.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0009", "text": "او به علت تصادف نابینا شد.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0010", "text": "درسش سر موقع شروع شد.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0011", "text": "خواندن این کتاب حدود یک هفته زمان می برد.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0012", "text": "این سخنرانی واقعاً مرا برانگیخت.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0013", "text": "یک شب زنده داری کنیم!", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0014", "text": "او فریفتش.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0015", "text": "امتحانات همگی تمام شدند.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0016", "text": "به نظرم می‌رسد که نظریات شما باطل هستند.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0017", "text": "تو با این زبان مشکل داری.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0018", "text": "هیچ کس نمی دانست که او به این خوبی فرانسه حرف میزد.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "lowres-tatoeba-fa-0019", "text": "انسان ها میدانند چگونگی به وجود آمدن زمین را توضیح دهند.", "lang": "fa", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono, pes)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
